The prebuilt toolchain bundles (released separately) contain binaries built
from the projects above: a Kotlin/Native distribution, Compose klibs and the
Compose compiler plugin, libKaldo, the LLVM ORC runtime, the Compose UIKit
helper library and LLVM command line tools. Each bundle carries this NOTICE
and the LICENSE file.

